@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false

title UC-04（a）开始救助并追加救助记录

actor "RESCUER" as Rescuer
participant "移动端\nUniApp" as App
participant "RescueTaskController" as C
participant "RescueTaskService" as S
participant "RescueTaskMapper" as TM
participant "RescueRecordMapper" as RRM
participant "OperationLogMapper" as OLM
database "MySQL" as DB

note over App,C
JWT 认证、账号状态检查和 RBAC 权限校验
由公共安全链完成，本图不重复展开。
end note

group 开始救助
  Rescuer -> App : 点击“开始救助”
  App -> C : POST /api/rescue-tasks/{taskId}/start
  C -> S : start(taskId, currentUserId)

  S -> DB : BEGIN
  S -> TM : conditional UPDATE\nWHERE id=taskId\nAND rescuer_id=currentUserId\nAND status=WAITING_START\n→ IN_PROGRESS + startedAt
  TM -> DB : UPDATE
  DB --> TM : affectedRows

  alt affectedRows = 0
    S -> TM : requery taskId
    TM -> DB : SELECT
    DB --> TM : row / none
    S -> DB : ROLLBACK
    S --> C : 40401 / 40901
  else affectedRows = 1
    S -> OLM : INSERT OperationLog\nRESCUE_TASK + START_RESCUE\nWAITING_START→IN_PROGRESS
    OLM -> DB : INSERT

    break 任一数据库写入或 OperationLog 写入失败
      S -> DB : ROLLBACK
      S --> C : 统一业务异常
    end

    S -> DB : COMMIT
    S --> C : StateActionResponse
    C --> App : 200 OK
  end
end

loop 0..N 次追加救助记录
  Rescuer -> App : 填写救助过程
  App -> C : POST /api/rescue-tasks/{taskId}/records
  C -> S : addRecord(taskId, currentUserId, content)

  S -> DB : BEGIN
  S -> TM : SELECT Task FOR UPDATE
  TM -> DB : SELECT ... FOR UPDATE
  DB --> TM : Task / none

  alt Task不存在 / 非负责人
    S -> DB : ROLLBACK
    S --> C : 40401 RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND
  else status != IN_PROGRESS
    S -> DB : ROLLBACK
    S --> C : 40901 BUSINESS_STATE_CONFLICT
  else 合法
    S -> RRM : INSERT RescueRecord\nrecorderId=currentUserId
    RRM -> DB : INSERT

    break 任一数据库写入失败
      S -> DB : ROLLBACK
      S --> C : 统一业务异常
    end

    S -> DB : COMMIT
    S --> C : RescueRecordResponse
    C --> App : 201 Created
  end
end

@enduml

